Z||000000||Taijiguy||03-31-2001||08:55 PM||||A beautiful day in Columbus, and the smell of fiberglass in the air. <BR>"What are you doing Taiji?" You might ask. I look over at you with a 'dog eating sh!t' grin on my face. "I can't tell ya.." I respond. "But when it's done, it'll be the awesomest mod you ever saw.."<BR>"Why can't ya tell me?" You inquire.<BR>"In case it comes out as F***ed up as it did last time I did it....."<BR>"Oh" you say knowingly....<P>To be continued...<P>(there may be *one* member who knows, but I trust him with my secret...) &lt;snicker&gt;||||reg||1
