Z||000004||Taijiguy||04-14-2001||11:30 PM||||The saga continues...you enter my garage to see me hard at work.<P>"So Taiji, back out here sniffin' fiberglass again I see.." you say with a smirk. <BR>"Yep" I answer, glassy eyed.<BR>"Are you ready to tell me what you're doing there?" You ask.<BR>"Well, I think it's gonna work this time" I respond,"So I'll let you in on the secret"<BR>"See them headlights over there?" I'm pointing to a set of lights from a 90's Berretta.<BR>"Yeah" you reply, the light coming on. "Oh hell no!" You exclaim. "You're glassing buckets and covers for those?!" It's a half statement/half question.<BR>"Yep" I say, taking another deep breath of fiberglass resin. "Gonna get some bulbs for 'em hot enough to start a brush fire, and wire them so they both come on when I hit the high beams"<BR>Then we both (all) just stand there like dogs watching a ceiling fan, the fiberglass having it's effect on our brains.<BR>"Let's go grab a beer." I say<BR>"Yeah."<BR>To be continued....again (with pics next time)  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
